  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n\r\nThe documentation website [revive.run](https://revive.run/) has been rebuilt with [Hugo](https://gohugo.io/), replacing the Gatsby site that had served the docs since 2018 (#74). See [mgechev/revive.run#89](https://github.com/mgechev/revive.run/pull/89) by @alexandear, closes #1647.\r\n\r\n### Features\r\n* Add new rule `use-slices-concat` by @alexandear in https://github.com/mgechev/revive/pull/1804\r\n* `identical-switch-branches`: add `allow-identical-default` option by @vaibhav8a in https://github.com/mgechev/revive/pull/1779\r\n* `unexported-return`: do not allow unexported interfaces by @tie in https://github.com/mgechev/revive/pull/1458\r\n* `redefines-builtin-id`: report `comparable` by @dylanpulver in https://github.com/mgechev/revive/pull/1786\r\n* `deep-exit`: improve report message by @alexandear in https://github.com/mgechev/revive/pull/1802\r\n\r\n> [!IMPORTANT]\r\n> `unexported-return` and `redefines-builtin-id` now report code that previous versions accepted, so existing projects may see new findings after upgrading.\r\n\r\n### Bug Fixes\r\n* `redundant-test-main-exit`: check only the return from `m.Run` by @alexandear in https://github.com/mgechev/revive/pull/1803\r\n* `enforce-slice-style`: suggest nil expressions by @fzlzjerry in https://github.com/mgechev/revive/pull/1790\r\n* Keep rule disabled on repeated disable directive by @alexandear in https://github.com/mgechev/revive/pull/1796\r\n* Add missed category and `ConfigurableRule` assertion by @alexandear in https://github.com/mgechev/revive/pull/1798\r\n\r\n### Documentation\r\n* Add release strategy by @alexandear in https://github.com/mgechev/revive/pull/1801\r\n* Add info about website contribution by @alexandear in https://github.com/mgechev/revive/pull/1793\r\n* Add Copilot code review instructions by @alexandear in https://github.com/mgechev/revive/pull/1797\r\n* Update GH templates; lint nested md files by @alexandear in https://github.com/mgechev/revive/pull/1784\r\n* Update revive docker version by @alexandear in https://github.com/mgechev/revive/pull/1782\r\n\r\n### Dependency Updates\r\n* Update module github.com/golangci/golangci-lint/v2 to v2.13.2 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/mgechev/revive/pull/1787\r\n* Update module golang.org/x/mod to v0.41.0 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/mgechev/revive/pull/1788\r\n* Update module golang.org/x/tools to v0.50.0 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/mgechev/revive/pull/1792\r\n* Update golang docker tag to v1.27.1 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/mgechev/revive/pull/1791\r\n\r\n### Chores & Internal\r\n* Check only exported functions by @alexandear in https://github.com/mgechev/revive/pull/1795\r\n* Keep only the error-path cases in `rule` by @alexandear in https://github.com/mgechev/revive/pull/1794\r\n* Update AGENTS.md with Go version and starring by @alexandear in https://github.com/mgechev/revive/pull/1778\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @vaibhav8a made their first contribution in https://github.com/mgechev/revive/pull/1779\r\n* @dylanpulver made their first contribution in https://github.com/mgechev/revive/pull/1786\r\n* @fzlzjerry made their first contribution in https://github.com/mgechev/revive/pull/1790\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/mgechev/revive/compare/v1.16.0...v1.17.0\r\n",
